<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the third round of matches in the Five Nations rugby union championship played on Saturday:</p>
<p>		   P  W  D  L   F    A    PTS</p>
<p>1.England	2  2  0  0   87   19    4</p>
<p>2.France	 2  2  0  0   59   37    4</p>
<p>3.Wales	  3  1  0  2   81   72    2</p>
<p>4.Ireland	3  1  0  2   47  103    2</p>
<p>5.Scotland     2  0  0  2   32   75    0</p>
<p>Results: Jan 18; Ireland 15 France 32, Scotland 19 Wales 34. Feb 1; England 41 Scotland 13, Wales 25 Ireland 26. Feb 15; Ireland 6 England 46, France 27 Wales 22. Remaining fixtures: March 1: England v France, Scotland v Ireland; March 15; Wales v England, France v Scotland.</p>
